 "remarks": "Welcome to sought-after Woodway Commons in Stamford's desirable Upper Springdale neighborhood, ideally located on the border of Darien and New Canaan. This exceptional 2-3 bedroom corner unit offers one of the best locations in the complex, featuring extra windows for abundant natural light and a private patio perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The well-appointed kitchen overlooks a spacious open-concept living and dining area, creating a seamless flow for everyday living and hosting guests. A convenient laundry room just off the main entry includes a washer, dryer, and generous storage space. The inviting living room showcases a beautiful fireplace and polished hardwood floors, adding warmth and character to the home. Upstairs, you'll find two generously sized bedrooms, each with ample closet space. The third floor provides incredible flexibility-ideal as a third bedroom, home office, gym, or playroom-along with additional storage. The home features four bathrooms: two full and two half baths, offering added comfort and convenience. Additional highlights include a covered carport, plenty of guest parking, and a private storage cage about 6'x 4'. A perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and location-just minutes from the Merritt Parkway and Metro-North for an easy commute.",
